  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The reaction&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>NO</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Br</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>NOBr</mi></math>&nbsp;takes place through the mechanism given below</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NO</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Br</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#8652;</mo><mrow/></mover><msub><mi>NOBr</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>fast</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NOBr</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>NO</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>NOBr</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>slow</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>The overall order of the reaction is _____.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>On applying Law of mass action&nbsp;over slowest step,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>[</mo><msub><mi>NOBr</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>]</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>NO</mi><mo>]</mo></math></p><p>The slowest step is the rate determining step.</p><p>On applying Law of mass action on equilibrium of Step I</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>NOBr</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>NO</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>Br</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>NOBr</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>NO</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>Br</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence, overall rate equation will be</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>NO</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>Br</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>NO</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>Br</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced></math></p><p>The overall order is equal to sum of the powers of the concentration terms in the rate law.</p><p>The overall order of the reaction is 3.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
